node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated by scripts/audit_library_opportunities.py
data/library_opportunities_audit.csv

# Transient Claude Code agent worktrees (auto-created/cleaned)
.claude/worktrees/

# Pinterest pin images -- generators render every pin in memory and upload
# it straight to Cloudflare R2 (see docs/pinterest-r2-migration.md); nothing
# is written under these directories by a normal run anymore. Ignored as a
# backstop in case a script or a manual export ever drops a file here.
# Inventory CSVs, generator scripts and the migration/validation tooling
# under scripts/ and data/ are unaffected and stay tracked.
assets/pinterest/
assets/collection-pins/
# also without the slash: "node_modules/" matches only a directory, and a symlink named
# node_modules was committed past it on 2026-09-02 (8380aa483)
node_modules

# Font binaries for the BUILD-TIME rasteriser are never committed (CLAUDE.md:
# no server-side renderer, no font binary feeding one).
# scripts/generate-printables-previews.py renders with Google Fonts fetched
# into a cache OUTSIDE the repo; this is the backstop for a stray copy.
#
# AMENDED 2026-09-19: this rule was written for cairosvg's TTF cache, not for
# webfont delivery, and it swept in .woff2 as a belt-and-braces catch. The site
# now SERVES woff2 from assets/fonts/ because Cloudflare Fonts was silently
# dropping 17 of the 24 families these pages declare (see assets/fonts/README.md
# for the measurement). That directory is unignored below; everywhere else the
# rule stands, and .ttf/.otf stay ignored everywhere including there.
*.ttf
*.otf
*.woff
*.woff2
!assets/fonts/*.woff2
